    (r"is above our pre-specified bar of \kappaBar{} at the point estimate but not across the whole interval.", r"is above our pre-specified bar of \kappaBar{} across the whole interval. (These labels correct an earlier faulty run of the Gemma judge; Appendix~\ref{app:judge}.)", "kappa interval now above the bar; disclosure"),
    (r"the rate is \tcObsKnownAbs{} on obscure entities and, by the judges, zero in 300 sampled replies on popular ones.", r"the rate is \tcObsKnownAbs{} on obscure entities and, by the judges, \cPopKnownAbs{} (one of 300 sampled replies) on popular ones.", "zero is now one reply in 300"),
