    (r"Llama and Gemma then abstain often and three judges agree (Fleiss $\kappa=\pmLlamaKappa$ and \pmGemmaKappa).", r"All five models then abstain often and three judges agree (Fleiss $\kappa$: Llama \pmLlamaKappa, Gemma \pmGemmaKappa, Qwen \pmQwenKappa, Mistral \pmMistralKappa, OLMo-2-7B \pmOlmoKappa).", "families now measured"),
    (r"Gemma's estimate has not had Llama's label corrections or relation resampling, and the prompt invites abstaining. For Qwen, Mistral and OLMo-2-7B, the judges disagree (Fleiss $\kappa$ \pmQwenKappa--\pmMistralKappa), so their preferences are unmeasured (point estimates \pmQwenDiff, \pmMistralDiff, \pmOlmoDiff; \cref{app:families}).", r"It is \pmQwenDiff{} \pmQwenDiffCI{} for Qwen and \pmMistralDiff{} \pmMistralDiffCI{} for Mistral; " + OLMO + r". These estimates have not had Llama's label corrections or relation resampling, and the prompt invites abstaining (\cref{app:families}).", "families now measured"),
